                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae224113-ff5c-4406-87fd-c03f6023dff4",
                                                "sense_id": "350309c6-871f-3845-849b-8be9d5ec6a9d",
                                                "text": "Matisse showed in every autumn salon and every independent. He was beginning to have a considerable following. Picasso, on the contrary, never in all his life has shown in any salon. His pictures at that time could really only be seen at 27 rue de Fleurus."
